---
// Architecture of AI-Gateway-API as implemented in the repository (app/ folder).
// `compact` shows the request path and error mapping only.
import Flow from "./Flow.astro";

type Props = { compact?: boolean };
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;

const errors = [
	{ code: "504", label: "Timeout" },
	{ code: "503", label: "Unavailable" },
	{ code: "429", label: "Rate limited + Retry-After" },
	{ code: "502", label: "Anything else" },
];
---

<figure class="space-y-4" aria-label="AI Gateway API architecture">
	<div>
		<p class="eyebrow mb-2">Request path</p>
		<Flow
			steps={[
				{ label: "POST /chat", detail: "FastAPI · Pydantic" },
				{ label: "AIService", detail: "times the call" },
				{ label: "AIProvider", detail: "async chat()" },
			]}
		/>
	</div>

	<div class="grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-2.5">
			<p class="text-[13px] font-medium">GeminiProvider</p>
			<p class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
				timeout per request<br />retry 429 / 500 / 503<br />2^n backoff + jitter
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-xl border border-dashed border-line px-3 py-2.5">
			<p class="text-[13px] font-medium">MockProvider</p>
			<p class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
				deterministic replies<br />no network, no API key<br />used in tests
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div>
		<p class="eyebrow mb-2">Typed errors → HTTP</p>
		<ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-4">
			{
				errors.map(({ code, label }) => (
					<li class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-2">
						<p class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-accent">{code}</p>
						<p class="text-[11px] leading-snug text-muted">{label}</p>
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
	</div>

	{
		!compact && (
			<>
				<div>
					<p class="eyebrow mb-2">Response</p>
					<pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-2.5 font-mono text-[12px] leading-relaxed"><code>{`{ "answer": "…", "model": "…",
  "usage": { "input_tokens": …, "output_tokens": … },
  "latency": … }`}</code></pre>
				</div>
				<div>
					<p class="eyebrow mb-2">Retrieval prototype · not yet exposed by the API</p>
					<Flow
						steps={[
							{ label: "Chunk text", detail: "overlapping windows", muted: true },
							{ label: "Embed", detail: "gemini-embedding-001", muted: true },
							{ label: "Rank", detail: "cosine similarity, top-k", muted: true },
						]}
					/>
				</div>
			</>
		)
	}
	<figcaption class="sr-only">
		Requests to POST /chat are validated with Pydantic and passed to an AIService, which times the call to an AIProvider.
		The Gemini provider applies a timeout and retries 429, 500 and 503 responses with exponential backoff and jitter;
		a mock provider is used for tests. Provider errors map to 504, 503, 429 or 502 responses.
	</figcaption>
</figure>
